7. Received inactivated, subunit, or recombinant influenza vaccine within 14 days prior to randomization, or any other vaccine within 28 days prior to randomization; Or plan to receive any vaccines within 28 days after the investigational vaccine.
8. Use of antipyretics, analgesics, or anti-allergic drugs within 3 days prior to randomization.
9. Have received blood or blood-related products (including immunoglobulins) within 3 months prior to randomization, or had planned to use during the trial.
10. Participants with the following diseases (based on inquiry and/or relevant diagnosis):

