② Renal function: creatinine (Cr) ≤ upper limit of normal (ULN) ×1.5; creatinine clearance (Ccr) ≥55 mL/min;

③ Liver function: total bilirubin ≤ULN ×1.5; ALT and AST ≤ULN ×2.5; (for intrahepatic cholangiocarcinoma or patients with liver metastases, total bilirubin must not exceed 3 times ULN, and transaminases must not exceed 5 times ULN);

