13. Use of immunosuppressive drugs or corticosteroids exceeding 10 mg/day prednisone equivalent dose within 14 days prior to enrollment. (14) Patients who have received radiation therapy, chemotherapy, targeted therapy, or immunotherapy within 4 weeks prior to enrollment;

(15) Pregnant or breastfeeding women; (16) Patients deemed unsuitable for enrollment by the investigator.

