10. Depression or anxiety requiring medication, current or past use of antidepressants within the past 3 months, or intention to use these medications or treatments during the intervention period;
11. Current or past use of hypnotic medications such as diazepam or triazolam within the past 2 weeks, or intention to use these medications during the intervention period;
12. Osteoarthritis, osteoporosis, or other musculoskeletal diseases requiring medication;
