17. Currently breastfeeding, having breastfed within the past 3 months, or planning to breastfeed during the study period;
18. Unable or unwilling to provide informed consent, complete questionnaires, or attend study visits;
19. Participation in other interventional studies;
20. Other conditions judged by the investigator as unsuitable for trial participation. These conditions may make potential participants highly unlikely to adhere to the study protocol, including plans to relocate, substance abuse, severe psychiatric issues, or severe dementia.

