* Age ≥ 18 years;
* WHO performance 0-2;
* To reduce the uncertainty in the assessment of relative flow after treatment, pre-treatment parotid gland saliva production stimulated with 5% citric acid should exceed \>0.1 ml/min

Exclusion Criteria:

