* PSA progression defined by a minimum of two rising PSA levels with an interval of ≥1 week between each determination.
* Radiological progression per RECIST 1.1;
7. For patients recruited to the abiraterone-onapristone combination arm, progression on abiraterone as their last line of treatment is required after a prior response to abiraterone;
